# CR 601.2h: a monocoloured hybrid shard ({2/W}) declined in favor of its
# generic side adds its own CMC (2) onto the cost's generic amount instead of
# spending white -- ChoosePayMonocoloredHybrid false, manapay.go -- so two
# units of generic are still asked for even though no coloured pip is paid.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19); the
# lands are tapped there, since a pool loaded by setup.state empties as the
# steps pass (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 C
tapformana human 2 C
queue paymonocoloredhybrid false
queue paygeneric C
queue paygeneric C
paymanacost human 2/W
